Set PCSBoot <Obey$Dir>.!InstallPC.Resources.Boot
Set PCSSoftware <Obey$Dir>.!InstallPC.Resources.Software
Set PCSNetlinks <Obey$Dir>.!InstallPC.Resources.Netlinks

Prefix <Obey$Dir>

Echo ** Boot
Copy ^.GuardDD.!GuardDD Boot.Choices.Boot.PreDesk.!GuardDD ~CF~V
Copy ^.PCSleep.PCSleep Boot.Choices.Boot.PreDesk.PCSleep ~CF~V
Prefix <Obey$Dir>.Boot
zip -r -u -I <PCSBoot> *

Echo ** Software
Prefix <Diva$Dir>.^
zip -r -u -I <PCSSoftware> !PC !PCConfig !MkBootDsc BugRep -x !PC.PCBits.ARMEdit.* !PC.PCBits.NetLinks.* !PC.PCBits.Sound.*

Echo ** NetLinks
Prefix <Diva$Dir>.PCBits
zip -r -u -I <PCSNetLinks> NetLinks

Settype <PCSBoot> Data
Settype <PCSSoftware> Data
Settype <PCSNetlinks> Data

Echo ** Zipping the whole lot up
Prefix <Obey$Dir>
zip -r InstallPC/zip !InstallPC InstToolbox !NewSystem

Echo ** Done
